; An amount under a metadata key that is written twice is read twice,
; though the directive keeps one: both count towards display precision.
; USD is written with two digits four times and without digits five times,
; two of them under a repeated key, so it shows none.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
  limit: 5 USD
  limit: 5 USD

2020-01-04 * "the same key twice"
  amount: 1 USD
  amount: 1 USD
  Assets:A   1.00 USD
  Assets:A  -1.00 USD

2020-01-05 * "two digits"
  Assets:A   10.00 USD
  Assets:A  -10.00 USD

2020-01-06 balance Assets:A 0 USD
